      "name": "Pehoski Purple Bulb Garlic",
      "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Pehoski Purple garlic is&nbsp;a Wisconsin-bred, purple stripe heirloom known for its vibrant purple-striped skin and robust, unique flavor.&nbsp;It has a strong, pungent flavor when raw, mellowing to a mild, earthy, and buttery taste when cooked, especially when roasted or sauteed.&nbsp;It's a versatile garlic, suitable for a variety of dishes and is known for its long storage life.&nbsp;</span></p>",
